<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="nav-container">
            <div class="nav-logo">
                <i class="fas fa-dice"></i>
                <span>Dice Bot</span>
            </div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/" class="nav-link">Accueil</a>
                <a href="/commands" class="nav-link active">Commandes</a>
                <a href="/docs" class="nav-link">Documentation</a>
                <% if (user) { %>
                    <a href="/dashboard" class="nav-link">Dashboard</a>
                    <a href="/logout" class="nav-link logout">Déconnexion</a>
                <% } else { %>
                    <a href="/login" class="nav-link login">Connexion</a>
                <% } %>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="commands-page">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="page-header">
                <h1>📚 Commandes</h1>
                <p>Découvrez toutes les commandes de Dice Bot</p>
            </div>

            <div class="commands-categories">
                <div class="category-card">
                    <div class="category-header">
                        <i class="fas fa-gavel"></i>
                        <h3>Modération</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="category-commands">
                        <span class="command-tag">/kick</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/ban</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/unban</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/warn</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/clear</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/mute</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/lock</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/slowmode</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/timeout</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="category-card">
                    <div class="category-header">
                        <i class="fas fa-cog"></i>
                        <h3>Administration</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="category-commands">
                        <span class="command-tag">/config</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/setup</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/autorole</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/welcome</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/logs</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/backup</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/reactionrole</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/serverstats</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="category-card">
                    <div class="category-header">
                        <i class="fas fa-wrench"></i>
                        <h3>Utilitaires</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="category-commands">
                        <span class="command-tag">/ping</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/help</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/userinfo</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/serverinfo</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/avatar</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/botinfo</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/invite</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/uptime</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="category-card">
                    <div class="category-header">
                        <i class="fas fa-gamepad"></i>
                        <h3>Fun</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="category-commands">
                        <span class="command-tag">/roll</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/coinflip</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/8ball</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/meme</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/joke</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/rate</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/ship</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/rps</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/trivia</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="category-card">
                    <div class="category-header">
                        <i class="fas fa-coins"></i>
                        <h3>Économie</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="category-commands">
                        <span class="command-tag">/balance</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/daily</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/work</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/pay</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/shop</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/buy</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/inventory</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/giveaway</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="category-card">
                    <div class="category-header">
                        <i class="fas fa-ticket-alt"></i>
                        <h3>Tickets</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="category-commands">
                        <span class="command-tag">/ticket</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/close</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/claim</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/rename</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/transcript</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="category-card">
                    <div class="category-header">
                        <i class="fas fa-gamepad"></i>
                        <h3>Roblox</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="category-commands">
                        <span class="command-tag">/robloxuser</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/robloxavatar</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/robloxgame</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/robloxgroup</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/robuxcalculator</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="category-card">
                    <div class="category-header">
                        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
                        <h3>Sécurité</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="category-commands">
                        <span class="command-tag">/antiraid</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/antinuke</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/security</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/audit</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/blacklist</span>
                        <span class="command-tag">/whitelist</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="commands-info">
                <p>💡 <strong>Astuce :</strong> Utilisez <code>/help catégorie</code> dans Discord pour voir les détails de chaque commande.</p>
                <p>📖 Consultez le fichier <a href="/docs">COMMANDS.md</a> pour la documentation complète de toutes les commandes.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="container">
            <p>&copy; 2024 Dice Bot. Tous droits réservés.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
